# gs_image_file_ex tick/update with jumps over several frames at once (frames in between are decoded to keep
# the library's canvas consistent), and a looped-around jump. 1x1 pixel, six frames with delays 1..6 cs.
file s6.gif 
img_init s6.gif straight
img_tex_init
img_tex
echo == skip ahead
img_tick 100000000 1
img_state
img_tick 100000000
img_update
img_tex
img_tick 300000000
img_update
img_tex
img_tick 1000000000
img_update
img_tex
img_state
img_free
